{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Celebration XL Book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Extra Large Celebration book unlocks 40 additional levels for Coloring Pixels! Show your support by purchasing this pack to help the developers in a time of need and play 40 brand new levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revisit new levels based on some of your favourite DLC packs from the past with this book, celebrating the best of Coloring Pixels so far!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Celebration XL book unlocks the following images:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Potion - Medieval</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebration - Emoji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinnabar - Gem and Minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sword - Fairy Tales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desert - Sci-Fi &amp; Fantasy Visats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thumbnails - Fantasy Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trash Panda - Animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Worm Hole - Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 More TBA</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698520?t=1746015563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698520?t=1746015563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698520/67d491490f36d48ecef074c6a64a31a723584ef1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746015563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698520/67d491490f36d48ecef074c6a64a31a723584ef1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746015563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descript